# Lets the kiosk app (running as the unprivileged ogmfx user) trigger a
# manual update/rollback through the root-side updater script -- the only
# privilege the in-app updater needs. The three entries pin the command
# AND its argument, so a compromised ogmfx account can only ask for the
# same fixed actions the timer already performs; nothing else runs as
# root. Everything else about the update (download, checksum, symlink
# swap, health check, rollback) runs inside ogmfx-update.sh as root,
# same as the periodic ogmfx-updater.timer path.
ogmfx ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/local/sbin/ogmfx-update.sh --force
ogmfx ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/local/sbin/ogmfx-update.sh --check
ogmfx ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/local/sbin/ogmfx-update.sh --rollback
